  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Lucky 7 Beach, a luxurious six-bedroom, five-bathroom home with two bonus rooms, located in the Seagrove Beach area along scenic 30A in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida. Designed to accommodate up to 16 guests in style and comfort, this upscale escape offers a private pool surrounded by lush tropical landscaping, a complimentary four-seat golf cart, and six adult bicycles for effortless exploration. Just .6 miles from the public beach access, this elegant home combines modern luxury with the laid-back charm of the Gulf Coast.<br><br>Step inside to find thoughtfully designed living spaces across two levels. The first floor includes two bedrooms, a full bathroom, a kitchenette, a dining area, two bonus rooms, each with twin beds, and a laundry room with a washer and dryer for added convenience. The living area opens to the backyard oasis, where the private pool and tropical setting create the ultimate vacation escape. Upstairs, the second-floor features four more bedrooms, including the primary suite with a balcony overlooking the pool and an ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower. A spacious living and dining area, a second laundry room, and a balcony with stairs leading down to the pool complete this stunning layout. Every bedroom, as well as the bonus rooms, comes equipped with a smart TV for added convenience.<br><br>The heart of the home is the fully equipped chef’s kitchen, complete with premium appliances, ample counter space, and all the cookware you need to prepare everything from a quick beach snack to a gourmet dinner. Whether you’re gathering around the dining table for a family meal or stepping outdoors to dine alfresco, this kitchen is designed to make entertaining easy and memorable.<br><br>The true highlight of this home is the backyard oasis, designed for both relaxation and entertainment. Spend your days lounging by the private pool, complete with a sun shelf and fountains, or gather in the evenings around the fire pit under the stars. The poolside patio offers plenty of space for outdoor dining, and amenities like the gas grill and outdoor shower make it easy to transition seamlessly between the beach and backyard. The pool can also be heated seasonally (additional fee) for added enjoyment. With a four-seat golf cart and six bicycles included, exploring the beauty of 30A has never been easier.<br><br>Located in the heart of 30A, this luxury retreat puts you close to everything Santa Rosa Beach has to offer. Enjoy pristine beaches, watersports, fishing, and scenic state parks, or spend your days discovering boutique shops and charming local dining. With so much to do nearby, every day brings a new adventure.<br><br>Treat yourself to the ultimate beach getaway and make unforgettable memories at this Seagrove Beach luxury escape, where upscale comfort meets coastal charm.<br><br>Clean Coverlet Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Lucky 7 Beach | Near Beach, Private Pool, Golf Cart + 6 Bicycles"
        }
      ],
