            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your positive feedback on your stay! We are glad to hear you enjoyed the amenities and location. We apologize for the inconvenience with the lack of supplies and will address this matter promptly.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The place was great overall, we loved using the bicycles and golf cart and were happy with the proximity to the beach and surrounding area, but the lack of toilet paper, beach towels and basic kitchen items like salt and pepper was a little inconvenient.",
