            "date": "Mar 15, 2026",
            "id": "56992612-8fee-4f7c-82f2-ec553955fa9f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you staying with us. Here at Southern Rental, we strive to ensure our guests' joy and comfort. We are happy that the units' intended expectations for you and your family were met. While Southern Vacation Rentals provides an initial supply of toilet paper, paper towels, hand soap, and trash bags to get guests through their first 24 hours, any additional items will need to be replenished by the guest. Condiments and Spices are not offered. Thank you again for taking the time to leave your review, and we are looking forward to welcoming you back for another exceptional experience!\nYour Southern Team",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Great house, great location. Clean and well kept. Not enough trash bags or the small things that save you from having to go get some incidentals that other properties in this price range would normally stock",
